<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AFTI - Qualification &amp; Training Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root { --bg:#0f172a; --card:#1e293b; --txt:#f8fafc; --primary:#27ae60; --accent:#38bdf8; }
        body { font-family:system-ui, sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--txt); padding:20px; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; min-height:100vh; margin:0; }
        .container { width:100%; max-width:900px; background:var(--card); border-radius:14px; padding:35px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .main-btn { display:block; width:100%; text-align:center; background:var(--primary); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; padding:18px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:bold; font-size:1.2rem; box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(39,174,96,0.3); margin:25px 0; }
        .section-title { font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--accent); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; margin-top:30px; border-bottom:1px solid #334155; padding-bottom:8px; font-weight:bold; }
        .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap:15px; margin-top:15px; }
        .sub-card { background:#0f172a; padding:18px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #334155; cursor:pointer; transition:border 0.2s; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
        .sub-card:hover { border-color:var(--accent); background:rgba(56,189,248,0.03); }
        .card-title { font-weight:bold; color:#fff; font-size:1rem; }
        .card-desc { font-size:0.85rem; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.4; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div style="text-align:center;">
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:2rem; font-weight:900;">🌾 The Agrarian Gateway</h1>
        <p style="color:#94a3b8; margin:0; line-height:1.6;">Agricultural Future &amp; Training Initiative Pre-Screening Network</p>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN INTERACTIVE IMMERSIVE STORY LAUNCHER -->
    <a href="farmer-apprentice-story.html" class="main-btn">🚀 Launch Immersive Qualification Path &rarr;</a>

    <!-- TECHNICAL MASTER DATA LAB SECTION -->
    <div class="section-title">📊 Technical Mastery Tutorials &amp; Checklists</div>
    
    <div class="grid">
        <!-- CATEGORY: SALES & DISTRIBUTION -->
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='sales-tutorial-farmstand.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🔨 Roadside Farm Stand Deployment</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Review structural building tiers, EFU zoning guidelines, and warning signage setup rules.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='sales-tutorial-merchandising.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🛒 Farmers Market Merchandising</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Master vertical display layering, abundance masking, and color contrast mapping styles.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='sales-tutorial-scripts.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🗣️ Customer Interaction &amp; Scripts</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Utilize open-ended curiosity prompts and learn how to handle pricing resistance natively.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='sales-tutorial-restaurants.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🤝 Commercial Kitchen Accounts</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Learn chef pitch etiquette windows, triple-wash packing rules, and carbon invoice logs.</span>
        </div>

        <!-- CATEGORY: PRODUCTION, SAFETY & OPERATIONS -->
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='ops-tutorial-tractor.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🚜 Utility Tractor Pre-Start Operation</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Execute fluid leak walks, check vertical ROPS cages, and review PTO gear shielding code rules.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='ops-tutorial-chainsaw.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🪚 Chainsaw Armor &amp; Log Tension</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Deploy safety ballistic chaps, ground-start cords, and calculate fiber over-buck stresses.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='prod-tutorial-propagation.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🌱 Greenhouse Propagation Cells</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Select cell geometry, mix sponge moisture test templates, and prevent damping-off molds.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='prod-tutorial-compost.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🪱 Organic Compost Pile Heating</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Balance 3:1 carbon recipes, execute 3x3x3 insulation frames, and log 131°F probe milestones.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='prod-tutorial-amendments.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🧪 Soil Chemistry Weight Math</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Interpret lab reports, calculate N-P-K fertilizer weights, and apply dolomitic lime.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='prod-tutorial-beekeeping.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🐝 Apiary Essentials &amp; Hive Security</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Assemble Langstroth super box grids, log mite rolling test data, and check honey water caps.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='eco-tutorial-restoration.html'">
            <span class="card-title">🌲 Post-Wildfire Watershed Restoration</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Install contour straw wattles, scarify burned hydrophobic clay, and hammer live willow stakes.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-card" onclick="window.location.href='admin-tutorial-grants.html'">
            <span class="card-title">📋 Land Lease Audits &amp; Grant Requests</span>
            <span class="card-desc">Review rolling 3-year term safety, map line water allocations, and itemize capital cost claims.</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
